1402 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 1400 0 R
  /Alt (Resampled z-values for the two ends of the range: the highly replicable extended-contact literature (Zhou 2019, left) and the fragile imagined-contact literature (Miles & Crisp 2014, right). Each overlays 100 resamples of one independent test per sample; the density is estimated separately either side of z = 1.96 (dashed). A curve that stays high to the right of the line indicates well-powered, replicable evidence.)
